-- Very Low BP
-- No Blaster Block
-- Pulses/Knockback/Knockdown
- Warrior's Repeater (Minigun 1)
-- Small Mag Size (Mag Reload)
-- 65% Slower RoF
-- 20% Faster Velocity
-- 15% More Damage

^3Powers:
- For Mandalore! (Team Energize 2)

^8Attributes:
